				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "d5f52a40-6b7b-4709-bcc6-9d4c1b0d28f8")
	)
	(text "Intended Switches;\n1. on-off-on: Carlingtech 2M1-SP1-T1-B1-M1RE\n2. on-on: E-Switch 100SP1T6B11M1REH\n3. on-(on): E-Switch 100SP2T6B11M1RE\nIf substituting - gold signal switches, not silver load switches.\n\nCables use:\n* Molex 0022013037 housing\n* Molex 0008550102 contact pins\n\nWire:\n* Alpha Wire AZ221934 family\n* TE Connectivity 55A0111-22 family\nIf Substituting - ETFE jacket, 22AWG, 19/34+ fine strand, tinned\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 141.478 186.182 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f44a517b-9f66-4dc4-9849-6db1a40765c2")
	)
